e now also the social backlash  yeah that's really a complicated  question because I mean nobody knows 100  for sure um but I would say that you  know the government has put itself in a  dead end we have for more than two years  an endless propaganda telling that  there's no alternative to zero covert  that China is the only place that  managed to you know contain the virus  and now we see that this strategy is not  sustainable anymore and  um they don't know how to change it in  the last months actually for more than a  year there's so much resources and  endless testing and quarantine  facilities and they fail to start a  nationwide vaccine campaign I mean now  the people over 80 years old  um there's a rate of less than 40  percent who had a booster shot so if now  we would open up completely I'm sure  there would be a lot of damage to the  people in terms of health so now it's  really there's not good options Left  Right correspondent Fabian they're  reporting for us from Beijing thank you  so much Fabian
 

